The MIT license above covers the code in this repository (notebooks,
scripts, and configuration) only. It does not apply to the underlying
Supreme Court oral argument dataset used to train and evaluate the
models here.

That dataset — transcripts and audio sourced from Oyez via the
`walkerdb/supreme_court_transcripts` mirror, cross-referenced against
ConvoKit's Supreme Court Oral Arguments Corpus — is licensed
CC-BY-NC (Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial). It is not
